@startuml
title Generate Wikidata Description RDF

start
:Read entity name and CLI options;
:Search Wikidata for candidate item IDs;

while (Need 2 entities with 2 clean phrases each?) is (yes)
  :Fetch Wikidata entity details;
  :Resolve Wikipedia sitelink title;
  :Fetch introductory Wikipedia phrases;
  :Clean quoted and parenthesized text;

  if (Entity has 2 unique phrases?) then (yes)
    :Extract candidate entity phrases;
    :Resolve phrases to Wikidata item IDs;
    :Find nearby verb predicates;
    :Fetch labels;
    :Build readable triples from extracted relations;
    :Build Turtle RDF only from those triples;
  endif
endwhile (no)

:Combine descriptions and RDF graphs;
:Append identifier, description, rdf, triples row to CSV;
stop
@enduml
